{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近映画をよく観るようになりました\n私が一番心が惹かれて\n何度も何度も見返した映画は\nシザーハンズ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切ない恋に泣けます(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に好きなシーンは\n雪の中少女が舞うところが\n好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おすすめの映画とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、握手会がありました！\n列、凄かった((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))\nたくさんの方((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))\n楽しかった((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫の髪型でお願いします\nってヘアメイクさんに言ったら\n「今日猫多いね〜」って\n言ってたのでえー？と思ったら\nちはるさんも黒猫でした♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮りたかった...\n残念。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本さんとひなちまさんの生誕祭\n参加したかったですo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまさんお誕生日おめでとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも握手会終わりとか\nライブ終わりのケータリングの前で\n残ってるお菓子をたくさん\nコートのポケットに入れて\nえへへ♡と言っているひなちまさん\nが可愛すぎます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお互い常習犯ですね♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会うと必ず今日は何を食べたかを\n報告し合います\n食いしん坊シスターズです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎告知◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木坂46SHOW! お説教部屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、佐々木、寺田の3人で\n出させてもらってます！\nぜひご覧ください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・UTB+ 2月9日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんと撮影させて\nいただきました\nこちらもまたぜひご覧ください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見せたことない姿が見れるかも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんらぶです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あともう一個映画で好きなのは\nフラガール。\n松雪泰子さん主演のフラダンスの\n映画っっ\n観た事ある方いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれをきっかけにフラダンス\nやりたくなった！\nでもバレエやってたので断念。\nバレエもフラダンスも似てるので\nいい勉強になりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい映画！どわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/02/04/2995088/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}